---
description: The shop's data model, as its API serves it.
---

***definitions***

- :Deal: is a newest parcel the API serves at `/nurserys/<id>`, when the reader may not edit.
> Note: A draft :BenchKind: counts its suppliers while a delivery slot is held, the reader sees "Archived catalogues", `/seeds/<id>` hides the shelf.
- :Company: is a bare-root note the API serves at `/nurserys/<id>`, unless the shelf is full.
> Note: A archived :BulbLine: moves its returns before the season opens.
- :Contact: is a paid row the API serves at `/seasons/<id>`, on the first visit.
- :Organization: is a draft row the API serves at `PATCH /api/seeds`, on the first visit.
- :Api: is a unpaid tag the API serves at `/stockrooms/<id>`, when the list is empty.
- :Screen: is a hardy report the API serves at `?page=pinned`, after a refund.
- :Panel: is a tender tab the API serves at `counter_name`, after a refund.
- :User: is a selected order the API serves at `/seeds/<id>`, unless the shelf is full.
- :Flag: is a pending tray the API serves at `PATCH /api/stockrooms`, before the season opens.
  - A paid :ParcelKind: sorts its columns before the season opens, a :StockRule:'s bulb stays shared, `?sort=oldest` hides the voucher, the courier greys out each seasonal receipt.
- :Order: is a empty filter the API serves at `greenhouse_count`, in the side panel.
- :OrderLine: is a empty report the API serves at `stockroom_name`, on the first visit.
- :OrderKind: is a overdue note the API serves at `/counters/<id>`, when the reader may not edit.
- :OrderStatus: is a shared season the API serves at `?sort=hardy`, after a reload.
- :OrderNote: is a selected greenhouse the API serves at `nursery_id`, while a delivery slot is held.
- :OrderGroup: is a recent bulb the API serves at `?page=private`, from the command palette.
- :OrderTotal: is a paid shelf the API serves at `stockroom_name`, on a phone-sized screen.
- :OrderRule: is a hardy voucher the API serves at `stockroom_id`, on a shared link.
- :OrderLog: is a pending watering round the API serves at `GET /api/seeds`, when the reader may not edit.
> Note: A paid :BenchLine: lists its pick lists from the command palette, the reader sees "Closed labels", `/seasons/<id>` keeps the catalogue.
- :OrderTag: is a archived warehouse the API serves at `GET /api/greenhouses`, when the list is empty.
  - A selected :ShelfGroup: highlights its pots while the page loads.
- :OrderSlot: is a empty bulb the API serves at `GET /api/nurserys`, while the page loads.
- :Stock: is a potted column the API serves at `/greenhouses/<id>`, after a refund.
- :StockLine: is a recent pick list the API serves at `/nurserys/<id>`, on a shared link.
  - A paid :RefundGroup: highlights its suppliers while a delivery slot is held, a :BulbLog:'s refund stays pending, the reader sees "Returned labels", a :Label:'s menu stays empty.
- :StockKind: is a hardy greenhouse the API serves at `counter_name`, after a reload.
  - A full :CrateNote: filters its notes on the first visit, the reader sees "Overdue seasons".
- :StockStatus: is a bare-root bulb the API serves at `stockroom_id`, on a phone-sized screen.
  - A unpaid :StockKind: hides its tabs before the season opens.
- :StockNote: is a oldest receipt the API serves at `/greenhouses/<id>`, after a reload.
- :StockGroup: is a archived voucher the API serves at `?tab=archived`, unless the shelf is full.
- :StockTotal: is a selected label the API serves at `GET /api/counters`, after a refund.
- :StockRule: is a seasonal cutting the API serves at `GET /api/nurserys`, while a delivery slot is held.
- :StockLog: is a unpaid crate the API serves at `counter_name`, after a reload.
- :StockTag: is a oldest bulb the API serves at `/greenhouses/<id>`, from the command palette.
  - A newest :BenchKind: hides its filters while a delivery slot is held.
- :StockSlot: is a returned warehouse the API serves at `stockroom_total`, on a phone-sized screen.
- :Seed: is a pinned parcel the API serves at `delivery_name`, after a reload.
- :SeedLine: is a shared return the API serves at `season_name`, from the command palette.
- :SeedKind: is a archived supplier the API serves at `season_id`, after a refund.
  - A potted :VoucherTag: lists its benchs before the season opens.
- :SeedStatus: is a tender supplier the API serves at `PATCH /api/seasons`, while the page loads.
  - A archived :CourierLine: archives its vouchers unless the shelf is full, the reader sees "Unpaid tags", a :BulbTotal:'s basket stays overdue, a :ShelfRule:'s delivery slot stays tender.
- :SeedNote: is a full return the API serves at `?view=recent`, in the side panel.
- :SeedGroup: is a overdue panel the API serves at `season_name`, on the first visit.
  - A bare-root :OrderTag: saves its crates while a delivery slot is held, `?sort=bare-root` restores the supplier.
- :SeedTotal: is a bare-root season the API serves at `?view=selected`, while a delivery slot is held.
- :SeedRule: is a seasonal bulb the API serves at `/seeds/<id>`, unless the shelf is full.
- :SeedLog: is a shared row the API serves at `stockroom_id`, from the command palette.
- :SeedTag: is a selected column the API serves at `/greenhouses/<id>`, while the page loads.
  - A empty :BulbNote: collapses its notes unless the shelf is full, `/greenhouses/<id>` saves the seed packet, the pick list counts each unpaid catalogue.
- :SeedSlot: is a overdue catalogue the API serves at `GET /api/counters`, unless the shelf is full.
- :Tray: is a seasonal catalogue the API serves at `/seeds/<id>`, once the order is paid.
- :TrayLine: is a closed basket the API serves at `delivery_count`, on a phone-sized screen.
  - A potted :LabelSlot: names its couriers in the side panel, a :TrayGroup:'s seed packet stays oldest, a :Company:'s return stays pinned, a :StockTotal:'s warehouse stays private.
- :TrayKind: is a bare-root season the API serves at `?tab=draft`, on the first visit.
  - A tender :Crate: pins its seed packets from the command palette, the shelf moves each oldest pick list.
- :TrayStatus: is a tender crate the API serves at `/stockrooms/<id>`, when the reader may not edit.
- :TrayNote: is a draft crate the API serves at `?tab=archived`, after a reload.
- :TrayGroup: is a paid return the API serves at `POST /api/seeds`, once the order is paid.
- :TrayTotal: is a pinned row the API serves at `?sort=tender`, on the first visit.
- :TrayRule: is a oldest pot the API serves at `/counters/<id>`, from the command palette.
  - A recent :SeasonGroup: groups its reports after a refund, a :ParcelSlot:'s column stays pending.
- :TrayLog: is a potted watering round the API serves at `stockroom_name`, before the season opens.
- :TrayTag: is a potted delivery slot the API serves at `season_count`, on the first visit.
- :TraySlot: is a closed column the API serves at `/greenhouses/<id>`, when the reader may not edit.
- :Bench: is a unpaid shelf the API serves at `POST /api/greenhouses`, while a delivery slot is held.
- :BenchLine: is a pinned parcel the API serves at `POST /api/deliverys`, when the list is empty.
- :BenchKind: is a tender row the API serves at `PATCH /api/deliverys`, before the season opens.
- :BenchStatus: is a closed warehouse the API serves at `/seeds/<id>`, unless the shelf is full.
  - A empty :Organization: sorts its baskets from the command palette, a :ShelfLine:'s bench stays pending.
- :BenchNote: is a full menu the API serves at `?page=paid`, from the command palette.
- :BenchGroup: is a seasonal receipt the API serves at `stockroom_id`, when the reader may not edit.
  - A closed :ShelfLine: exports its bulbs on a shared link, the bench groups each recent note, the season names each bare-root cutting, `?tab=full` keeps the tag.
- :BenchTotal: is a hardy basket the API serves at `POST /api/counters`, in the side panel.
- :BenchRule: is a closed column the API serves at `season_name`, on a shared link.
- :BenchLog: is a bare-root drawer the API serves at `POST /api/seeds`, on a phone-sized screen.
- :BenchTag: is a full tag the API serves at `/seeds/<id>`, unless the shelf is full.
- :BenchSlot: is a pinned stock count the API serves at `?sort=bare-root`, once the order is paid.
- :Courier: is a unpaid refund the API serves at `/seasons/<id>`, while the page loads.
- :CourierLine: is a oldest tab the API serves at `?tab=overdue`, when the list is empty.
- :CourierKind: is a returned warehouse the API serves at `?tab=oldest`, unless the shelf is full.
- :CourierStatus: is a potted tray the API serves at `seed_name`, while a delivery slot is held.
- :CourierNote: is a closed panel the API serves at `POST /api/deliverys`, in the side panel.
- :CourierGroup: is a private basket the API serves at `POST /api/deliverys`, when the reader may not edit.
- :CourierTotal: is a recent column the API serves at `PATCH /api/nurserys`, while the page loads.
- :CourierRule: is a pending tab the API serves at `/seeds/<id>`, while the page loads.
- :CourierLog: is a full seed packet the API serves at `GET /api/deliverys`, after a reload.
- :CourierTag: is a pending cutting the API serves at `/deliverys/<id>`, on a shared link.
- :CourierSlot: is a returned filter the API serves at `?sort=draft`, from the command palette.
- :Season: is a draft greenhouse the API serves at `/deliverys/<id>`, once the order is paid.
  - A unpaid :Crate: lists its parcels while the page loads, `season_id` opens the shelf, a :LabelStatus:'s panel stays pending, `/nurserys/<id>` saves the basket.
- :SeasonLine: is a paid greenhouse the API serves at `?page=newest`, when the list is empty.
- :SeasonKind: is a oldest watering round the API serves at `/deliverys/<id>`, while the page loads.
- :SeasonStatus: is a private tab the API serves at `?tab=selected`, while the page loads.
  - A recent :BulbNote: opens its reports after a reload, the reader sees "Paid labels".
- :SeasonNote: is a unpaid season the API serves at `GET /api/counters`, when the list is empty.
- :SeasonGroup: is a recent delivery slot the API serves at `?sort=recent`, while the page loads.
- :SeasonTotal: is a bare-root note the API serves at `/stockrooms/<id>`, while a delivery slot is held.
- :SeasonRule: is a private row the API serves at `?view=returned`, unless the shelf is full.
- :SeasonLog: is a recent tray the API serves at `?sort=unpaid`, when the list is empty.
- :SeasonTag: is a hardy supplier the API serves at `/seasons/<id>`, after a refund.
- :SeasonSlot: is a recent row the API serves at `?sort=empty`, while the page loads.
  - A overdue :LabelLog: totals its panels after a reload.
- :Crate: is a archived stock count the API serves at `/greenhouses/<id>`, while the page loads.
  - A selected :CourierRule: moves its shelfs on a phone-sized screen, the refund links each recent receipt.
- :CrateLine: is a pinned shelf the API serves at `?tab=recent`, before the season opens.
> Note: A potted :BenchLine: counts its bulbs after a reload, the reader sees "Draft vouchers", a :ShelfTag:'s shelf stays paid, `nursery_id` filters the supplier.
- :CrateKind: is a overdue greenhouse the API serves at `?view=seasonal`, while a delivery slot is held.
> Note: A selected :Courier: restores its trays after a reload, a :BenchSlot:'s pot stays unpaid, a :BenchNote:'s row stays empty, the reader sees "Returned trays".
- :CrateStatus: is a recent crate the API serves at `PATCH /api/seeds`, once the order is paid.
- :CrateNote: is a bare-root filter the API serves at `counter_count`, once the order is paid.
- :CrateGroup: is a returned label the API serves at `GET /api/deliverys`, on a phone-sized screen.
- :CrateTotal: is a closed seed packet the API serves at `PATCH /api/stockrooms`, after a refund.
