- :CrateSlot: is a private tab the API serves at `/counters/<id>`, after a refund.
- :Label: is a hardy greenhouse the API serves at `?sort=paid`, once the order is paid.
  - A bare-root :Parcel: sorts its reports on a phone-sized screen, the reader sees "Potted labels", the reader sees "Pending tags".
- :LabelLine: is a archived receipt the API serves at `/seasons/<id>`, on a shared link.
- :LabelKind: is a archived note the API serves at `/nurserys/<id>`, on a phone-sized screen.
